First of all, if you've read Michael Moorcock's Elric books,
which I haven't, Arioch is the bloodthirsty demon who Elric follows,
and Stormbringer is Elric's rather chaotic sword.
If you didn't already have Stormbringer, you would have gotten it;
instead you got a regular broadsword, big, heavy, and sharp.
I don't know if it's enchanted or +0; keep it around unless you've
already got a good spare sword.

- Minor spoilers follow -

Being chosen by Arioch, in nethack, is the chaotic equivalent of
being chosen Hand Of Elbereth.  You now have all kinds of intrinsics
like fire resistance, but you shouldn't get greedy and pray as often
as you have in the past, because Arioch or Elbereth has already
given you a lot of long-lasting gifts.

